@startuml eof-questionnaire-sequence-p1
title EOF questionnaire - Page 1/3 : what the audit launches on its own

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E0F0F4
  BorderColor #5BA1BC
  FontColor #1C2856
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E0F0F4
  BorderColor #5BA1BC
  FontColor #1C2856
}
skinparam ArrowColor #5BA1BC
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #5BA1BC
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #ECECF2
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #5BA1BC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #E0F0F4
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9BD0DD
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Auditor" as U #82C1DD
participant "Claude\n(skill analyse-parcours)" as C #82C1DD
participant "run_eof.py" as REOF #DBDDE5
participant "generate_report_html.py" as GR #DBDDE5
database "audit-dir/" as FS #9BD0DD

note over U, FS
  True for any audited site.
  Everything below is triggered by the audit,
  without asking anyone anything.
end note

== Steps 10 to 37 - Capture and measurements ==

U -> C : /analyse-parcours <audit-dir>
C -> FS : HAR, Coverage, cwv.json, env-data.json,\nhtml-css-criteria.json, wellknown-scan.json

note over C, FS
  All these probes observe the service from the outside.
  None of them talks to the team operating it.
end note

== Step 39 - Automatic EOF audit ==

C -> REOF : python3 run_eof.py <audit-dir>
REOF -> FS : Read the already collected files
FS -> REOF : Observed data
REOF -> REOF : Settle each reference criterion\nwhen a datum allows it
REOF -> FS : lots/automatic-judgment.json
REOF -> FS : eof-audit-results.json
REOF -> FS : eof-filled.md
REOF -> FS : eof-radar-<domain>.svg
REOF -> C : Criteria answered out of 70,\noptimization potential

note over REOF, FS
  The ceiling of this step is not a tooling defect.
  Most of the 70 criteria concern internal facts
  about the team: code reviews, tests, knowledge of
  the target users. No technical datum reaches them.
  These criteria come out as "no answer".
end note

== Step 40 - HTML report ==

C -> GR : python3 generate_report_html.py <audit-dir>
GR -> FS : Read eof-audit-results.json\n+ eof-radar-<domain>.svg
FS -> GR : EOF results
GR -> FS : journey-report-YYYY-MM-DD.html
C -> U : Report delivered

note over U, FS
  STOP. THE PIPELINE STOPS HERE.
  No step calls generate_questionnaire.py.
  The report therefore only contains what was measured, never an
  answer from the team operating the service.
  Continued: page 2/3.
end note

@enduml
